  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the mincemeat and cook until it is browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add the soy sauce, vinegar, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the lomo saltado hot, garnished with chopped green onions and a side of rice or noodles."
